  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 16307adf14f5f81409b8dac9eb0b259e, type: 3}
  dialogue:
  - Hey! Get your rear end the duck over to the targeting console now!
  - You've been sent targeting data, we need you to fire immediately. Time is of
    the essence!
  - The controls are on the table, left lever for elevation and the right one for
    azimuth. Once its dialed in the lever next to the lights fires the gun.
